index 7cf5a94..f96e49e 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -1,3 +1,11 @@
+## 2.2.4 API hotfix – 2026-07-12
+
+- Search-a-licious request narrowed to `langs=de,main` and compact candidate fields.
+- Primary search deadline reduced to 2 seconds before the single OFF legacy fallback.
+- Legacy request payload reduced and explicit popularity sorting removed.
+- Diagnostics now state when both public transports were executed but unreadable to the browser.
+- Fixed Playwright role/dedupe assertions, static `/api-diagnose.js` proxy collision, and three axe contrast findings.
+
 # Changelog
 
 ## 2.2.4
